Entities 3.3 build: 9639 released: 2014-08-24 compiled with: Java 1.8.0_131 Jet jet12.0-pro-x86/1.8.0_131

Converts HTML/XML/XHTML entities to char and back, also strips HTML/XML/XHTML tags.

